{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12101320","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12101320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1210132001:0":{"text":"안녕하세요. 몸이 안 좋은 사람이 있는데, 하루 묵어갈 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"您好，我们有人身体不适，可以留宿一晚上吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B4F4A1642786E99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210132002:0":{"text":"돈부터.","source_cn":"钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x428109EF4606321D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210132003:0":{"text":"윽, 물에 빠졌을 때 지갑을 잃어버렸어요...","source_cn":"呃，之前落水的时候，我们的钱袋都遗失了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF9FB041FC74B870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210132004:0":{"text":"난 자선 활동은 안 해. 나가서 어디 오두막이나 찾아보라고.","source_cn":"老子不搞慈善，出门找个窝棚睡去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B853D752FE1C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210132005:0":{"text":"이봐, 이봐, 형씨! 이 사람들은 내가 데려온 사람들이야.","source_cn":"嘿，嘿，老兄！这是我带来的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3202A73F155C5AE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210132006:0":{"text":"잠깐 얘기 좀 하자고.","source_cn":"咱们借一步说话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84A588628A4C4B39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210132007:0":{"text":"또 너야? 말해 봐, 이 사람들이 대체 누군데?","source_cn":"又是你，说，这群人什么来头？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC67BCA16596CB3D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210132008:0":{"text":"바다에서 내가 구해준 사람들이야. 이것 좀 보라고...","source_cn":"海边捡来的。你瞧这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC4715218981C9E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210132009:0":{"text":"...이 녀석, 대단한걸! 나한테 맡겨.","source_cn":"……行啊，你小子！这活老子接了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C08DD878B58263E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210132010:0":{"text":"그럼 부탁 좀 할게. <style=\"highlight\">이 친구들을 잘 좀 돌봐 줘</style>!","source_cn":"那就麻烦你，<style=highlight>好好照顾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9D2FB13BBBC790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210132011:0":{"text":"이제 막 식사 준비가 끝났으니, 밥부터 먹도록 해.","source_cn":"刚好厨房做好了饭，你们先吃吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC9F3B483F57F876","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210132012:0":{"text":"어라, 돈은요?","source_cn":"诶，不用给钱了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF966C901037DE9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210132013:0":{"text":"내가 모처럼 선심 쓰는 거야. 선심엔 값을 매길 수 없는데, 얼마를 낼래?","source_cn":"老子难得发一回善心，善心无价，你能出多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46ECF208A878688","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1210132014:0":{"text":"보르스는 나와 친분이 있으니, 걱정 말고 여기서 지내.","source_cn":"波尔斯和我有点交情，你们安心在这住着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC5CA6E72042E314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1210132015:1":{"text":"그럼 식사해. 난 이만 가볼게.","source_cn":"那你们就吃着，我先走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDA0DADB40471B8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1210132016:1":{"text":"고마워요, 신밧드.","source_cn":"非常谢谢你，辛巴达。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D60696E39442E9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docum